    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_fairybb_03",
      "hash64": "90B02886A38D9798",
      "text": "你真的很厉害！\\n一般情况下我很想为你庆祝……[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "90B02F86A38DA37D",
      "text": "但是现在的……这个情况，\\n对我们来说会很复杂，\\r\\n需要整理一下才行……[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
